# Autonomous Delivery Robot - State Transition Table

| Transition ID | From State | Event | To State | Req ID |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| T1 | IDLE | Delivery Request Received | NAVIGATING | R2 |
| T2 | NAVIGATING | Obstacle Detected | AVOIDING_OBSTACLE | R4 |
| T3 | AVOIDING_OBSTACLE | Obstacle Avoided | NAVIGATING | R5 |
| T4 | NAVIGATING | Destination Reached | DELIVERING | R6 |
| T5 | DELIVERING | Delivery Successful | RETURNING | R7 |
| T6 | NAVIGATING | Critical Battery | RETURNING | R8 |
| T7 | RETURNING | Warehouse Reached | IDLE | R9 |

## Verification Checks

| Check | Expected Result | Req ID |
|---|---|---|
| IDLE → DELIVERING | Invalid Transition | R10 |
| NAVIGATING → AVOIDING_OBSTACLE | Valid Transition | R4 |
| AVOIDING_OBSTACLE → NAVIGATING | Valid Transition | R5 |
| AVOIDING_OBSTACLE → DELIVERING | Invalid Transition | R10 |
| NAVIGATING → DELIVERING | Valid when Destination Reached | R6 |
| DELIVERING → RETURNING | Valid when Delivery Successful | R7 |
| NAVIGATING → RETURNING | Valid when Critical Battery occurs | R8 |
| RETURNING → IDLE | Valid when Warehouse Reached | R9 |


